## 1. Prerequisites
Before starting, ensure you have the following installed:
- [Conda](https://docs.conda.io/en/latest/miniconda.html) (Miniconda or Anaconda)
- [Node.js and npm](https://nodejs.org/)
- [Git](https://git-scm.com/)
