## 🆘 Support

- **Documentation**: Check the built-in help system
- **Issues**: Report bugs and feature requests on GitHub
- **Discussions**: Join the community discussions

## 🚀 Roadmap

- [ ] Docker containerization
- [ ] Real-time collaboration features
