**BotanikAI** is a professional plant-based treatment recommendation app using LLMs.

## Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  User --> Frontend
  Frontend --> API
  API --> LangChain

  subgraph RAG Engine
    LangChain --> Mistral
    LangChain --> BaseCSV
    LangChain --> Unsplash
  end
```

```mermaid
flowchart TB
  subgraph RAG Engine
    UserQuery[""🧑‍🌾 Question utilisateur""]
    Embedder[""🔤 Embedding via Mistral""]
    Retriever[""📂 Recherche dans CSV / base enrichie""]
    Context[""📄 Contexte pertinent""]
    PromptTemplate[""🧩 Prompt Template""]
    LLM[""🤖 Mistral (LLM)""]
    Response[""✅ Réponse générée""]

    UserQuery --> Embedder
    Embedder --> Retriever
    Retriever --> Context
    Context --> PromptTemplate
    PromptTemplate --> LLM
    LLM --> Response
  end
```


