|-----------|---------|-------------|
| **OS** | Windows 10, macOS 10.15, Ubuntu 20.04 | Windows 11, macOS 12+, Ubuntu 22.04+ |
| **CPU** | 4 cores | 8+ cores |
| **RAM** | 8GB | 16GB+ |
| **GPU** | None (CPU inference) | NVIDIA GPU with CUDA (faster inference) |
