ai_agents.py,ai_agents.py,c9489ec101936a77657b226eadbbbd652b06b272,Axle-Bucamp/RH-AutomationAgent,https://api.github.com/repositories/1008957122/contents/ai_agents.py?ref=c79cc94516f43b50c42fa625b603648de43fa684,https://api.github.com/repositories/1008957122/git/blobs/c9489ec101936a77657b226eadbbbd652b06b272,https://github.com/Axle-Bucamp/RH-AutomationAgent/blob/c79cc94516f43b50c42fa625b603648de43fa684/ai_agents.py,just an agent that automate some RH needs and do some visualisation,,0,0,0,2,2025-06-26T11:52:48Z,0,0,"## 🧠 VektorHR API

A modular and extensible backend service built with **Flask**, designed for OSINT analysis, user management, and AI-driven assessments. It includes static file serving, RESTful API routing, and CORS support, with persistent storage via SQLite.

---

### 📁 Project Structure

```
vektorhr-api/
│
├── src/
│   ├── models/
│   │   └── user.py
│   ├── routes/
│   │   ├── user.py
│   │   ├── osint.py
│   │   └── analysis.py
│
├── static/                  # Static web frontend (index.html etc.)
├── database/app.db          # SQLite database
├── app.py                   # Main entry point
├── requirements.txt
├── .env
├── .gitignore
├── .dockerignore
├── Dockerfile
└── README.md
```

---

### 🚀 Quickstart (Local)

#### 1. Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/vektorhr-api.git
cd vektorhr-api
```

#### 2. Set Up a Virtual Environment

```bash
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate  # On Windows use: venv\Scripts\activate
```

#### 3. Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

#### 4. Run the Application

```bash
python app.py
```

The API will be available at: [http://localhost:5000](http://localhost:5000)

---

### 🐳 Run with Docker

#### 1. Build the Docker Image

```bash
docker build -t vektorhr-api .
```

#### 2. Run the Container

```bash
docker run -d -p 5000:5000 --name vektorhr vektorhr-api
```

Visit: [http://localhost:5000](http://localhost:5000)

---

### 🛠 Endpoints

| Method | Route               | Description                      |
| ------ | ------------------- | -------------------------------- |
| GET    | `/health`           | Health check                     |
| GET    | `/`                 | Serves index.html or static      |
| Any    | `/api/user/...`     | User-related endpoints           |
| Any    | `/api/osint/...`    | OSINT tools and data access      |
| Any    | `/api/analysis/...` | AI/ML analysis tools and reports |

> All routes under `/api` are registered via Blueprints for modular structure.

---

### 🔒 Environment Variables

> (You can optionally create a `.env` file)

```env
SECRET_KEY=vektorhr-secret-key-2024
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///database/app.db
```

---

### 🧪 Development Notes

* CORS is enabled globally (`*`)
* SQLite database auto-creates tables on first run
* Static frontend is served from `/static` (can be React, Vue, etc.)
* Modular routes: Add new blueprints to `src/routes/`

---

