1. [Overview](#overview)
2. [Key Features](#key-features)
3. [System Architecture](#system-architecture)
4. [Workflow](#workflow)
5. [Technical Stack](#technical-stack)
6. [Getting Started](#getting-started)
   - [Prerequisites](#prerequisites)
