## 🔧 Key Configuration

### Search Parameters
- `top_k`: Number of initial search results (default: 20)
- `max_products`: Maximum products returned (default: 10)
- Medical device filtering for Georgian terms
- Price-based sorting for ""იაფი"" (cheap) queries

### Memory Settings
- Conversation context: Last 6 messages
- Session-based memory with LangGraph MemorySaver
- Automatic context vs. search decision making

## 📊 API Documentation

### Endpoints

- `POST /chat` - Main chat interface
- `GET /search` - Direct product search
- `GET /sessions/{session_id}/history` - Get chat history
- `GET /health` - Health check

