[![IdeaWeaver Tests](https://github.com/ideaweaver-ai-code/ideaweaver/actions/workflows/basic-test.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/ideaweaver-ai-code/ideaweaver/actions/workflows/basic-test.yml)
