## Agent Workflow Architectures

### RAG Agent Workflows

#### Self RAG Workflow

```mermaid
graph TB
    A[Start] --> B[Query Input]
    B --> C[Generate Initial Response]
    C --> D[Self-Reflection]
    D --> E[RAG Retrieval]
    E --> F[Response Refinement]
    F --> G[Final Response]
```

#### Corrective RAG Workflow

```mermaid
graph TB
    A[Start] --> B[Query Input]
    B --> C[Initial RAG]
    C --> D[Generate Response]
